msgid "筛选"
msgstr "Filtering"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:3
#: 31e8d7e0b13741d3a9c788f940a7d403
msgid "这两张卡片处理整批结构，而不是逐个生成新构型："
msgstr ""
"These cards process a batch of structures instead of generating new "
"configurations one by one:"

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:5
#: 8042b9701422490bb0f1b4c3eb77dac4
#
msgid "先用 `几何健全性过滤` 删除违反明确几何阈值的结构。"
msgstr "Use `Geometry Sanity Filter` first to remove structures that violate explicit geometric thresholds."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:6
#: c3fee6be40bf4d1fa25c24f29904e3b1
#
msgid "必要时在 `NEP 数据集查看` 中继续复核异常结构。"
msgstr ""
"If needed, continue reviewing anomalous structures in `NEP Dataset "
"Display`."

#: ../../source/module/make-dataset-cards/categories/filter-sampling.md:7
#: 1f4c8c477ce34af483b0b0c4cfccf939
#
msgid "候选池基本干净后，再用 `FPS 代表性采样` 选择代表结构。"
msgstr "Once the candidate pool is reasonably clean, use `FPS Sampling` to select representative structures."

#~ msgid "过滤与代表性采样"
#~ msgstr "Filtering and representative sampling"
